  "content": "<p>此模组为 Macaw 的桥梁、栅栏、屋顶、家具、楼梯模组以及 Sajevius 创建的模组提供了多兼容支持。</p>\n<p>该模组将自动添加使用其他模组材料制成的桥梁、屋顶或栅栏。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>我已经安装了 Macaw's Bridges - Sajevius，我担心安装此模组会删除所有已放置的桥梁。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>不用担心，此模组会将旧兼容性中的所有旧方块和物品转换为新格式。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组是 Macaw 模组的非官方附加组件。如果模组出现崩溃或错误，请在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题页面</a> 报告。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持的模组：</strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>- Betterlands</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/611/721/2023-01-19_10.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>- Shroomed</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/611/723/2023-01-19_10-1.png\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>必需依赖项：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong>AddonsLib</strong></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">可选依赖项：</span></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shroomed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shroomed</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterlands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Betterlands</a>&nbsp;</p>",
